                "reviews": [
                    {
                        "recommendationid": "22236207",
                        "author": {
                            "steamid": "76561197970326787",
                            "num_reviews": 14,
                            "playtime_forever": 414,
                            "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0,
                            "playtime_at_review": 323,
                            "last_played": 1504816556
                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Void 21 and me went through lows and highs but I think we managed to get along quite well! \n\nCan it be rage inducing ? Hell yes\nIs it unfair ? Nope!\n\nAnd that's the best thing about it. I love games that punish you for not paying attention without rubbing a \"haha we designed this to make you ragequit!\" Shield in your face. \nIt's incredibly rewarding to beat a hard level and the speed feeling is amazing, there are tons of unlocks to make life easier and/or completely change the way you experience the game. \n\nThe controls are very easy to learn and work perfectly with keyboard, never died thinking \"that wouldn't have happened with a gampad...\" unlike many other racing games out there.\n\nI'm also a huge fan of the graphics it's a welcome change to all the pixelated-shooter-survival-games out there and honestly it fits just perfectly without looking bland or boring and even it it may look like it, it never gets confusing or hard to see where you need to go to not smash in a wall. \n\nAs a special addition: The Music is just awesome, try the Demo to see what I mean.\n\n12/10 would crash my ship again",
                        "timestamp_created": 1459777017,
                        "timestamp_updated": 1459777017,
